{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37563","headline":"颜惠詹事即孤侄舅氏谪官黔巫舟中相遇怆然有寄 · 郑谷","name":"颜惠詹事即孤侄舅氏谪官黔巫舟中相遇怆然有寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"犹子在天末，念渠怀渭阳。\n巴山偶会遇，江浦共悲凉。\n谪宦君何远，穷游我自强。\n瘴村三月暮，雨熟野梅黄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑谷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37563.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37563","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}